{"id":"n37605-1-16","stage":1,"title":"테니스 · 网球","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37605-1-16-1","ko":"유민 씨는 제일 잘하는 운동이 뭐예요?","zh":"裕敏，你最擅长的运动是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하는","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동이","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"根据定好的规则和方法活动身体，较量能力或技术。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/879cd57dee7c51e52441.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37605-1-16-2","ko":"대학생 때부터 테니스를 쳤는데, 학교 대회에서 우승도 했었어요.","zh":"我从大学时期就开始打网球，还拿过学校比赛的冠军呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대학생","meaning":"大学生","explanation":"대학생：大学生","readings":[{"term":"대학생","audio":"/audio/12ac14be4eec99bb2fe1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66320","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"테니스를","meaning":"网球","explanation":"테니스：网球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"테니스","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37605","senseId":"1","lemma":"테니스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쳤는데,","meaning":"打，玩，抽","explanation":"치다：打，玩，抽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"4","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대회에서","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우승도","meaning":"冠军，第一名","explanation":"우승：冠军，第一名；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우승","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69495","senseId":"1","lemma":"우승","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했었어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"12ac14be4eec99bb","term":"대학생","zh":"大学生","audio":"/audio/12ac14be4eec99bb2fe1.mp3","entryId":"66320","definition":"读大学的学生。","pronunciation":["대ː학쌩"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"aa5ded493982a07e","term":"테니스","zh":"网球","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3","entryId":"37605","definition":"中间挂一道网，双方各据一边，用拍子来回打球而比胜负的运动比赛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打，玩，抽","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"用手或手持物品击打物体的游戏或运动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"31e52393f3eb0c17","term":"우승","zh":"冠军，第一名","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3","entryId":"69495","definition":"在比赛中全部战胜对方，获得第一。","pronunciation":["우승"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/87483b1d4547db6a0445.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.512,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37605","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0641,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我从大学时期就开始打网球，还拿过学校比赛的冠军呢。","裕敏，你最擅长的运动是什么？","智秀，我看起来怎么样？我试着换了种风格哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏，你最擅长的运动是什么？","智秀，我看起来怎么样？我试着换了种风格哦。","我从大学时期就开始打网球，还拿过学校比赛的冠军呢。"],"answer":2}]}
